Man, this game is TOTALLY worth your time. Of all the free games on steam, No More Room in Hell shines through like Solaire´s summon sign. I´ve been playing this game for some years now, and its community is still alive and active. Here are some pros and cons for the game:
PROS: Free to play;
Cool community, large and active (yes, there are SOME annoying kids like there are in every other online game);
Nice graphics, maps and textures for a free-to-play game;
Good multiplayer;
Depressing soundtrack and ambience;
CONS: Some bugs;
The character walking animation in 3rd person is weird, it´s like all characters are walking with something up their a**;
CAN get kind of boring;
There hasn´t been an update for almost a year (which could mean they could be working on something pretty damn cool, or maybe not).
Hope this helped for anyone new to it!

-A lot of server lag;
-Can't trade with the rest of people if you don't pay for a premium account;
